{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>For the seven years of famine, etc.</b> The meaning is: first and foremost, there will be a sufficiency for the land of Egypt to sustain its own hungry, and afterwards for the other lands. And this is what the verse means — after telling of the famine in Egypt, <b>and the land shall not be cut off</b>, etc. — here it included all the earth."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:36.427924934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}